{"version":1,"k1":1.5,"b":0.75,"ids":["readme_md","readme_md__h1","readme_md__h9","readme_md__h20","readme_md__h32","readme_md__h38","readme_md__h58","readme_md__h67","readme_md__h78"],"docs":["Entity: README.md\nType: document\nFile: README.md\nLocation: L1\nCommunity: 0\nNormalized: readme.md","A compact Linux GUI to switch DNS servers and flush the DNS cache \u2014 inspired by **DNS Jumper** for Windows.\n\nBuilt with **Rust**, **Relm4**, and **libadwaita**. Changes go through **NetworkManager** (`nmcli`); cache flush uses **systemd-resolved** (`resolvectl`).\n\nWorks on KDE Plasma (Adwaita chrome) and GNOME.","- Pick a NetworkManager connection\n- Show current effective DNS\n- Built-in presets (Cloudflare, Google, Quad9, AdGuard, OpenDNS, Mullvad)\n- Custom DNS servers and user-defined groups\n- Apply DNS / restore automatic (DHCP) DNS\n- Auto-backup before first change; manual backup & restore\n- Resolve-latency benchmark (real DNS lookup, not ping) + apply fastest\n- One-click DNS cache flush","- NetworkManager\n- GTK 4 + libadwaita\n- `resolvectl` (systemd) recommended for cache flush\n\nArch / CachyOS:","Entity: Build & run (development)\nType: document\nFile: README.md\nLocation: L32\nCommunity: 0\nNormalized: build & run (development)","Or manually:\n\n\nFor packaging, see [`packaging/PKGBUILD.local`](packaging/PKGBUILD.local) (build from this tree) and [`packaging/PKGBUILD`](packaging/PKGBUILD) (AUR release tarball).","1. Select your Wi\u2011Fi or Ethernet connection.\n2. Choose a DNS preset (or add a custom one from the menu).\n3. Click **Apply DNS** (Plasma may ask for your password via polkit).\n4. Optionally **Flush Cache**, **Benchmark**, or **Apply Fastest**.\n\nConfig and backups live in `~/.config/dns-jump/`.","DNS Jump does **not** edit `/etc/resolv.conf` by hand. On modern Arch desktops that file points at systemd-resolved. Instead it sets:\n\n\non the selected NetworkManager connection, then brings the connection up and flushes caches with `resolvectl flush-caches`.","MIT"],"metadatas":[{"label":"README.md","file_type":"document","source_file":"README.md","community":0,"node_id":"readme_md","chapter":"","section":"","heading":"","heading_level":0},{"label":"DNS Jump","file_type":"document","source_file":"README.md","community":0,"node_id":"readme_md__h1","chapter":"","section":"","heading":"","heading_level":0},{"label":"Features","file_type":"document","source_file":"README.md","community":0,"node_id":"readme_md__h9","chapter":"","section":"","heading":"","heading_level":0},{"label":"Requirements","file_type":"document","source_file":"README.md","community":0,"node_id":"readme_md__h20","chapter":"","section":"","heading":"","heading_level":0},{"label":"Build & run (development)","file_type":"document","source_file":"README.md","community":0,"node_id":"readme_md__h32","chapter":"","section":"","heading":"","heading_level":0},{"label":"Install on Arch (from this repo)","file_type":"document","source_file":"README.md","community":0,"node_id":"readme_md__h38","chapter":"","section":"","heading":"","heading_level":0},{"label":"Usage","file_type":"document","source_file":"README.md","community":0,"node_id":"readme_md__h58","chapter":"","section":"","heading":"","heading_level":0},{"label":"How it works","file_type":"document","source_file":"README.md","community":0,"node_id":"readme_md__h67","chapter":"","section":"","heading":"","heading_level":0},{"label":"License","file_type":"document","source_file":"README.md","community":0,"node_id":"readme_md__h78","chapter":"","section":"","heading":"","heading_level":0}],"tf":[{"entity":1,"readme":3,"md":3,"type":1,"document":1,"file":1,"location":1,"l1":1,"community":1,"normalized":1},{"compact":1,"linux":1,"gui":1,"to":1,"switch":1,"dns":3,"servers":1,"and":3,"flush":2,"the":1,"cache":2,"inspired":1,"by":1,"jumper":1,"for":1,"windows":1,"built":1,"with":1,"rust":1,"relm4":1,"libadwaita":1,"changes":1,"go":1,"through":1,"networkmanager":1,"nmcli":1,"uses":1,"systemd-